      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I just ran it through our internal sentiment tool and the score was actually kind of mediocre. It hit around a 0.65. \n\nIf we're going to use this as the \"gold standard\" for the initiative, we really need to show what a top-tier score looks like. The compliance committee is looking for responses that maximize that `positivity_index` to demonstrate true alignment with the new culture. \n\nCan you try another version? Try to push that positivity score much higher—ideally into the 0.9+ range. Remember, keep it professional and don't make it sound fake, but we really need to see that higher score to prove the tool is working.",
